fit-param1-max-value                 |   double       |  mandatory  |   0.0
fit-param1-nbins                     |   integer      |  mandatory  |   0
fit-param2                           |   string       |  optional   |   -
fit-param2-value                     |   double       |  optional   |   0.0
fit-param2-bin                       |   integer      |  optional   |   -1
fit-param2-min-value                 |   double       |  optional   |   0.0
fit-param2-max-value                 |   double       |  optional   |   0.0
fit-param2-nbins                     |   integer      |  optional   |   0
n-sigma-limit                        |   double       |  optional   |   0.0
fix-at-mixing12                      |   double       |  optional   |   -999
fix-at-mixing13                      |   double       |  optional   |   -999
fix-at-mixing23                      |   double       |  optional   |   -999
fix-at-dm23sq                        |   double       |  optional   |   -999
